  <Sequence DisplayName="API 호출 (JSON)" sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="서버에 JSON 요청을 한 번 보내고 상태 코드와 응답을 돌려준다. (본문·API 키는 로그에 남기지 않는다)"><ui:InvokeCode DisplayName="HTTP 요청 보내기 (Invoke Code)" Language="VBNet" Code="&apos; 서버(백엔드) JSON API 호출 한 번. API 키는 로그·오류 메시지에 넣지 않는다.&#xA;httpStatus = 0&#xA;respBody = &quot;&quot;&#xA;netError = &quot;&quot;&#xA;Try&#xA;    Using client As New System.Net.Http.HttpClient()&#xA;        client.Timeout = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(60)&#xA;        client.DefaultRequestHeaders.Add(&quot;X-API-Key&quot;, apiKey)&#xA;        Using req As New System.Net.Http.HttpRequestMessage(New System.Net.Http.HttpMethod(httpMethod), baseUrl.TrimEnd(&quot;/&quot;c) &amp; apiPath)&#xA;            If Not String.IsNullOrEmpty(bodyJson) Then&#xA;                req.Content = New System.Net.Http.StringContent(bodyJson, System.Text.Encoding.UTF8, &quot;application/json&quot;)&#xA;            End If&#xA;            Using resp As System.Net.Http.HttpResponseMessage = client.SendAsync(req).GetAwaiter().GetResult()&#xA;                httpStatus = CInt(resp.StatusCode)&#xA;                respBody = resp.Content.ReadAsStringAsync().GetAwaiter().GetResult()&#xA;            End Using&#xA;        End Using&#xA;    End Using&#xA;Catch ex As System.Exception&#xA;    netError = ex.GetType().Name &amp; &quot;: &quot; &amp; ex.Message&#xA;End Try" sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="HttpClient로 요청을 보낸다. 연결 자체가 실패하면 netError에 사유가, 서버가 응답하면 httpStatus에 상태 코드가 들어온다."><ui:InvokeCode.Arguments><scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, Argument"><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="baseUrl">[baseUrl]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="apiKey">[apiKey]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="httpMethod">[httpMethod]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="apiPath">[apiPath]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="bodyJson">[bodyJson]</InArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" x:Key="httpStatus">[httpStatus]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="respBody">[respBody]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="netError">[netError]</OutArgument></scg:Dictionary></ui:InvokeCode.Arguments></ui:InvokeCode><ui:LogMessage DisplayName="API 호출 로그" Level="Info" Message="[&quot;[API] &quot; &amp; httpMethod &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; apiPath &amp; &quot; → &quot; &amp; If(netError &lt;&gt; &quot;&quot;, &quot;연결 실패(&quot; &amp; netError &amp; &quot;)&quot;, &quot;HTTP &quot; &amp; httpStatus.ToString)]" /></Sequence>
